      "NIKKI GIOVANNI: Wait, let me get a photo of you for your mom before you head back in. That hat is so cute.\nARIEL ECTON: You know you could just take a picture with your phone?\nNIKKI GIOVANNI: You always say that. But as I and the universe have been trying to tell you all day... there's no substitute for the real thing.\nARIEL ECTON: Yeah yeah.",
      "ARIEL ECTON: Why?—\nBIANCA TYSON: Oh shit! The Peach Set.",
      "BIANCA TYSON: Oooooo let's luxuriate.\nCLARA ARMSTRONG: Yes. Let's.",
      "ARIEL ECTON: Hey. I'm Ariel.\nEMILY KATZ: Hey, sorry I can't talk right now. Surrender could be any second.\nARIEL ECTON: Um... What's... I'm sorry... Surrender?\nEMILY KATZ: Our phones... Ya know where we have to surrender our phones to make sure nothing leaks and all that...",
      "ARIEL ECTON: What's going on?\nMAUDE: First Roll."
    ]
